                            <resolved>Mon, 1 Apr 2024 06:30:30 +0000</resolved>
                                    <version>5.0-beta</version>
                                    <fixVersion>5.0.0</fixVersion>
                                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>1</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17786591" author="JIRAUSER303052" created="Thu, 16 Nov 2023 03:27:46 +0000"  >&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&quot;The query node restores metadata from Hdfs when it starts up, which changes kylin.metadata.url to @hdfs&quot;, causing the JdbcShareStateStore to fail to retrieve the real metadata url based on KylinConfig. getInstanceFromEnv().getMetadataUrl(), which results in a failure to get the real metadata url. getInstanceFromEnv().getMetadataUrl() to get the real metadata url, which leads to the subsequent error report (reported sandbox what can not be connected)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13064439/13064439_image-2023-11-16-11-26-21-749.png&quot; height=&quot;527&quot; width=&quot;756&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13064440/13064440_image-2023-11-16-11-27-24-225.png&quot; height=&quot;520&quot; width=&quot;821&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;FixDesign%C2%A0&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Fix Design&#160;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Backup the value of &quot;kylin.metadata.url&quot; before the &quot;kylinConfig.setProperty(&quot;kylin.metadata.url&quot;, kylinConfig.getMetadataUrlPrefix() + &quot;@hdfs&quot;);&quot; logic. &quot;kylin.metadata.url&quot; to the &quot;kylin.jdbc.share.state.url&quot; property of KylinConfigBase.&lt;br/&gt;
The code reference is as follows.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13064437/13064437_image-2023-11-16-11-21-11-650.png&quot; height=&quot;347&quot; width=&quot;693&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To get the metadata url in JdbcShareStateStore use the above backup value getJdbcShareStateUrl().&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The code reference is as follows.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13064438/13064438_image-2023-11-16-11-25-33-742.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
